//! member: false
//! bore - the boreutils utilities in one program, each chosen by the name it
//! is run under: a link named after a utility is that utility, given the
//! arguments its own program would be given. `bore NAME ARG...` runs
//! NAME on the ARGs.
//!
//! Six utilities are not here: dd, shred, sleep, sync, tail and timeout name
//! calls that make the runtime start a signal hub or link its thread path,
//! which every utility here would then pay for on every run. They stay
//! separate programs.
//!
//! Nothing runs, opens or changes before the utility starts: the table is
//! the only lookup.

